fficial_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854080-1846651706694709","game_id":"steam-3854080","kind":"update","title":"The final demo, “Diagnosis in the Mist,” has been update!","summary":"Steam Next Fest Demo · Diagnosis in the Mist Approximately 60,000 words of new story content, featuring three new locations to investigate!Please note: Due to the branching storyline, this update does not extend the time limit or advance the time system. You can still investigate freely.First, here are the three new locations:WhitechapelGreat Ormond StreetHampstead Square (Daytime)Great Ormond Street and Hampstead Square (Daytime) follow directly from two existing cases and can be unlocked by me","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:43:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694709","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854080-1846018067939793","game_id":"steam-3854080","kind":"announcement","title":"Interwoven Dream Crowdfunding Is Live! See What's Inside! 🎉","summary":"Dear Readers, the doors to London in 1884 are finally open! 🎉We've prepared plenty of exciting surprises this time, with a variety of crowdfunding tiers designed for readers with different interests!✉️ Just want to support the game? Choose the ¥38 \"Official Publication\" tier to receive a Steam key and have your name featured in the game's Special Thanks credits!📖 Love collecting exclusive merchandise? From \"Letters from London\" to \"Evening Gazette Special Edition,\" we've prepared a wonderful col","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T02:20:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854080-1838407329268491","game_id":"steam-3854080","kind":"announcement","title":"The 'Moss-Covered Name' version has now been updated! Developer logs and more~","summary":"From the Development Team:We rarely post development updates. For a story-driven game, revealing anything about the content always seems to go hand in hand with the risk of spoilers.However, now that we have reached the middle of the year, it seems that we should still show our faces, after all, many players have been very concerned about how things are progressing.*Multilingual Versions:We place great importance on the experience of players using other languages. Full-text localization is curre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T09:01:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329268491","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854080-1834602721189977","game_id":"steam-3854080","kind":"announcement","title":"The mobile demo is now simultaneously available","summary":"To our dear readers: Our game has now launched a trial version of its mobile game on TapTap.This mobile test only includes adaptation for a selection of devices. Currently, the mobile version is only available for Android systems and can be downloaded via the TapTap client. We will continue to optimize the mobile control logic and improve device compatibility and content in future updates. If you encounter any issues or adaptation bugs during gameplay, you are welcome to join our official commun","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T09:19:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721189977","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854080-1830797770232116","game_id":"steam-3854080","kind":"update","title":"Chapter 2 Update Coming Soon！","summary":"To provide a better gameplay experience, the English localization for Chapter 2 will be arriving slightly later and will go live simultaneously with a feature update! This update will be released as soon as possible in the coming days. Thank you for your continued support!Upcoming optimizations include:· Quick review feature for recently read content.· Quick-jump navigation when obtaining evidence and clues.· Refined logic for certain story branches.· Improved loading speed across all scenes.· F","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-23T03:16:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770232116","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854080-1821288646587141","game_id":"steam-3854080","kind":"announcement","title":"推理游戏节demo直播","summary":"推理游戏节demo直播","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-13T02:14:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646587141","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854080-1821288646587111","game_id":"steam-3854080","kind":"announcement","title":"Interwoven dream demo is now available！","summary":"This first demo opens with 130,000 words of content, spanning from the Prologue through part of Chapter Two. We will continue updating the demo until it includes the complete Chapter Two.We’d like to share a special message with our dear players around the world.💬 Join Our Discord!We’d love to hear your feedback and ideas: Discord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-13T01:54:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646587111","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854080-1816849002022709","game_id":"steam-3854080","kind":"announcement","title":"The first offline trial at the WePlay exhibition has successfully concluded!","summary":"Thank you for your support, players! We are pleased to announce that an English version will be available in the upcoming online demo. Stay tuned!Join our discord：https://discord.gg/zFsRzDYyaY","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-25T08:09:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002022709","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3854080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3854080":"2026-10-26T11:01:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3854080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:10Z"},"4042110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:10Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3854080","app_id":3854080,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3684fcf40a84426947a16cbc83efc86efc48416853173580cdc3803d815c0be1","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"《Interwoven Dream》 is